1
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,640
We lost 300 ryo, thanks 
to your meddling.

2
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,440
We won't go back empty-handed.

3
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:04,900
If your hands are so 
empty, will you hold this?

4
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:36,300
Is it true they hired you 
for only twenty ryo?

5
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,390
Yes.

6
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:42,270
The sword we stole was a treasure 
given to them by the Shogun.

7
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:46,400
And they'll only pay 
twenty to get it back?

8
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,320
Ridiculous!

9
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,740
They're a poor, small clan.

10
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:55,410
Trying to swindle 300 ryo for 
a sword is asking too much.

11
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,410
Shut up! Damn you!

12
00:02:02,830 --> 00:02:05,210
Looks like a nasty 
storm's brewing...

13
00:02:05,370 --> 00:02:07,040
Can't waste my time here!

14
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:14,340
Ninja Scroll

15
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:21,910
Oh, I'm sorry for you.

16
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,160
That was one hell of a storm!

17
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:27,160
That's right! My roof got blown 
off and scared my wife so bad...

18
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,960
...that she went into labor.

19
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,630
It was really something.

20
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:33,000
That's your seventh kid, right?

21
00:03:33,130 --> 00:03:34,500
Nope, the ninth.

22
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:37,630
Whoa! You must really 
love your wife!

23
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:43,220
Isn't that Sakichi's daughter 
from Shimoda Village?

24
00:03:44,260 --> 00:03:46,220
What's with her?

25
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:53,230
What's wrong?!

26
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,240
All... dead...

27
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:05,080
Everybody's dead.

28
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,450
Dead?!

29
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:11,710
Plague... Plague did it...

30
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:18,670
My god !

31
00:04:19,130 --> 00:04:22,140
This area's off limits! 
No one goes through!

32
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:25,810
This road's closed until 
the epidemic is over.

33
00:04:25,970 --> 00:04:28,180
Epidemic?! The hell with that!

34
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:31,730
What is it?

35
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:35,520
Sir, my scout saw a 
strange group of men

36
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:39,700
ride toward Shimoda 
Village late last night.

37
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:43,160
It might have something 
to do with this

38
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,660
epidemic so I came to 
tell you, Chamberlain.

39
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:51,290
Meaning what? That they spread a plague 
as they passed through the village?

40
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,880
Ridiculous! Why 
would they do that?

41
00:04:54,710 --> 00:04:56,380
Something's fishy.

42
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,340
Let it alone.

43
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,260
On second thought, we can't.

44
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,760
This is the order to 
all of you Koga ninja.

45
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,850
Go to Shimoda Village and 
find what really happened.

46
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:10,890
Sir!

47
00:05:10,890 --> 00:05:14,190
One more thing. If any of 
your people get infected...

48
00:05:15,230 --> 00:05:16,820
Understood, sir.

49
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:19,820
The first group will follow the 
Shirakawa River from the north.

50
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:23,200
The second will cross 
Taro Pass from the west.

51
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:26,200
You'll reach Shimoda Village 
in about an hour. Understand?

52
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:30,870
Hikoza saw them. There were only eight. 
No match for us.

53
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,870
Our real enemy is this epidemic.

54
00:05:35,170 --> 00:05:36,630
True.

55
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,390
Kagero...

56
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:59,070
You intend to leave 
me behind, Hanza?

57
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:02,860
You have your own 
duties, don't you?

58
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:06,110
Poison tasting is very important. 
Don't forget that.

59
00:06:06,780 --> 00:06:11,080
While our lord is away from his 
domain, the work isn't necessary.

60
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:13,710
Until he returns...

61
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:15,080
I am one of the Koga ninja!

62
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:18,090
I cannot take you.

63
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:21,090
You could all be 
killed out there.

64
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:25,430
How can I just sit and 
wait here alone?!

65
00:06:41,730 --> 00:06:45,900
Kagero's gotten even 
more beautiful.

66
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,120
All the more reason to pity her.

67
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,700
It's her destiny. 
She must hate it.

68
00:06:51,330 --> 00:06:54,330
Enough. Where are 
Hikoza and the others?

69
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:57,290
They were right behind us. 
I'll have a look.

70
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,430
Hey! What are you doing?

71
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:20,020
What the...?!

72
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:48,430
There!

73
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:07,990
Shit!

74
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:22,210
Who was that freak?

75
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:26,000
Forget it. I don't want 
to see him again, anyway.

76
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:29,220
I am 
Kagero of the Koga ninja.

77
00:08:30,550 --> 00:08:33,890
Jubei. Kibagami Jubei.

78
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:38,270
The town of Kakio is to the west. 
Our paths part here.

79
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:30,110
Oh, hi...

80
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:34,780
I know the way now, so...

81
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,700
Ow...

82
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:43,290
Okay, I got it. Are we done now?

83
00:09:44,210 --> 00:09:47,630
There's no reason we 
should kill each other.

84
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,720
If you're not going to end this... 
I will!

85
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,760
Like hell!

86
00:10:06,810 --> 00:10:10,980
Strange skill you have. But 
it can't hurt my body.

87
00:10:12,690 --> 00:10:13,650
Seems that way.

88
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:32,010
What's wrong, Monster? Your 
skin's starting to crumble!

89
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:36,470
Die!

90
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,370
Splendid !

91
00:11:03,370 --> 00:11:06,830
Your sword flew swift 
as the wind itself and

92
00:11:06,830 --> 00:11:10,170
slashed your enemy like 
a cyclone's touch.

93
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:15,220
He was no match for you. 
Why don't you join me?

94
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:20,050
Your skills will be of great help 
for me to fight the likes of him.

95
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:25,230
You're joking. Who'd want to 
fight a monster like him again?

96
00:11:26,270 --> 00:11:29,230
You'll have to. They 
won't leave you alone.

97
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:33,320
You just killed one of the 
Eight Devils of Kimon.

98
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:38,860
You didn't beat him 
by yourself, though.

99
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:44,790
That Koga ninja woman... 
Interesting technique she uses.

100
00:12:01,550 --> 00:12:05,270
Lord Genma. All is 
proceeding as planned.

101
00:12:11,310 --> 00:12:16,030
It arrives from the Shogun of the 
Dark by six tomorrow evening.

102
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:21,410
Very well. Write 
to him in return.

103
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:27,950
"We return in three days. There's 
nothing to worry about."

104
00:12:27,950 --> 00:12:29,120
At once.

105
00:13:13,170 --> 00:13:16,790
Where are you headed?

106
00:13:18,090 --> 00:13:20,760
No place in particular. You?

107
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:27,430
I'm looking for somebody, and you 
look exactly like him, so...

108
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:32,140
Strangers can look alike. I'm 
Kibagami Jubei, a wanderer...

109
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:46,450
It was most certainly your face.

110
00:13:46,780 --> 00:13:50,700
Tessai was able to make 
an impression of it.

111
00:14:07,350 --> 00:14:09,180
Just leave me the hell alone!

112
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:20,150
A cast-off skin.

113
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:23,610
She shed it like a 
snake and escaped.

114
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,370
A gang of freaks, one and all.

115
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:35,040
You've no obligation. I just 
didn't want you to die yet.

116
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:38,330
Who are these Eight 
Devils of Kimon?

117
00:14:39,290 --> 00:14:41,460
A group of ninja who work 
for the Shogun of the Dark.

118
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:43,420
You know of the 
Shogun of the Dark?

119
00:14:43,090 --> 00:14:46,510
He wants to rebuild the Toyotomi 
clan, the former rulers of Japan.

120
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:50,850
He has 16 lords behind him and is 
trying to expand his influence.

121
00:14:50,850 --> 00:14:54,020
The most dangerous enemy 
of the Tokugawa Shogunate.

122
00:14:54,350 --> 00:14:58,480
His power is supported in the 
shadows by the Eight Devils.

123
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:01,020
What are they up to 
here in Mochizuki?

124
00:15:02,070 --> 00:15:05,400
That's what I came here to find out. 
It's a tough job.

125
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:10,070
Why don't you work for 
me, for 100 ryo?

126
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:14,040
A Tokugawa spy wants 
to hire a ninja?

127
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:18,210
I'm afraid I have no choice. 
It's an emergency.

128
00:15:18,210 --> 00:15:21,630
Only I managed to make 
it here to Mochizuki.

129
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:24,510
The Eight Devils killed everyone 
else in my party on our way here.

130
00:15:24,510 --> 00:15:27,130
I need your help by all means!

131
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:31,140
You'll never get away from them.

132
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:33,470
You'll have to fight 
them sooner or later.

133
00:15:33,470 --> 00:15:36,680
Join me. You can kill two 
birds with one stone, right?

134
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:41,150
I don't think so. Now why don't 
you just leave me alone?

135
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:46,110
I see. Too bad.

136
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:48,820
Such a pity...

137
00:15:51,450 --> 00:15:54,990
You'll lose your precious life.

138
00:15:56,370 --> 00:15:57,500
You're stubborn.

139
00:15:57,100 --> 00:16:01,580
No, what I speak of is literally of 
life or death importance to you.

140
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:06,130
You see, that shuriken 
was poisoned.

141
00:16:06,130 --> 00:16:08,680
It won't kill you instantly, 
but in a day and a

142
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:11,470
night, when it starts to 
work, nothing can stop it.

143
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:17,560
Unless you get the antidote. 
And only I know what it is.

144
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:20,400
Work for me and I'll tell 
you the antidote along

145
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:22,860
with the hundred ryo 
when the job is done.

146
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:25,900
You're bluffing.

147
00:16:31,410 --> 00:16:33,070
I speak the truth.

148
00:16:33,070 --> 00:16:36,100
Tell me now. What's 
the antidote?

149
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:41,210
Not until you work for me. Kill 
me and you've killed yourself!

150
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,880
Now you'll need the 
antidote for yourself.

151
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:52,340
Poor boy... You've 
so much to learn.

152
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:55,140
That isn't the one that hit you.

153
00:16:55,850 --> 00:16:58,470
I threw THAT one away.

154
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:02,600
Shit!

155
00:17:03,650 --> 00:17:08,190
Kibagami Jubei... You've lost... 
amateur!

156
00:17:09,530 --> 00:17:12,950
My name is Dakuan. 
How do you do?

157
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:18,620
So, Benisato...

158
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:23,120
This man, Kibagami Jubei, is a 
remnant of the Shogunate's spies?

159
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:25,080
Possibly.

160
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:27,130
Why didn't you kill him?

161
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:28,880
Someone interfered.

162
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,130
No excuses!

163
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:37,470
If he's a government spy, 
he'll show up here soon.

164
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:39,520
Be sure to kill him this time.

165
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:42,020
I don't need your 
advice to do that.

166
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:48,520
Jubei...

167
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:52,900
There's something 
I've been wondering.

168
00:17:53,610 --> 00:17:56,740
Are you, by chance, the 
ninja who killed the chief

169
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:59,660
retainers of the Yamashiro 
clan five years ago?

170
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:04,170
He was supposedly a master 
swordsman, like you.

171
00:18:07,210 --> 00:18:10,090
The retainers had 
gorged themselves with

172
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:13,260
gold they secretly dug 
out of a hidden mine.

173
00:18:13,510 --> 00:18:17,100
The ninja must have killed 
them by order of the lord

174
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:18,760
who wanted to report the 
mine to the government.

175
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:22,680
Because if the government found 
the hidden gold mine first...

176
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,600
the lord would have 
lost his fief.

177
00:18:25,310 --> 00:18:29,860
But does that ninja know that after 
the retainers were killed...

178
00:18:29,860 --> 00:18:32,440
the government received 
no report about the mine?

179
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:34,400
Why?

180
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:40,030
If a government spy like you knows all 
that, then why don't you do something?

181
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:45,710
No... Even the government can't 
move without definite evidence.

182
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:48,840
Our spies tried many 
times to infiltrate the

183
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:52,210
clan to find evidence, 
but none returned alive.

184
00:18:52,380 --> 00:18:53,760
The Shogun of the Dark...

185
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:57,050
He stopped them by 
using the Kimon ninja.

186
00:18:57,840 --> 00:19:01,140
Why is the Shogun of the Dark 
helping the Yamashiro clan?

187
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:05,600
Simple. He wants the 
gold mine for himself.

188
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:11,980
Do you know how he found the 
mine before the government?

189
00:19:12,610 --> 00:19:15,150
Somebody gave him 
the information.

190
00:19:15,150 --> 00:19:18,740
Somebody who was the leader of 
the ninja of the Yamashiro clan.

191
00:19:19,990 --> 00:19:21,700
Himuro... Genma?!

192
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,700
Precisely.

193
00:19:25,910 --> 00:19:29,380
I doubt that. He isn't 
in this world anymore.

194
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:33,460
No, he's still very much alive. 
And you'll see him soon.

195
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:36,720
Himuro Genma is the boss 
of the Kimon monsters.

196
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,800
Shh! Not so loud !

197
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,850
You can't trick me 
the same way again!

198
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:46,100
Don't be hasty. You'll 
soon know the truth.

199
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:51,650
But you must admit that you 
and he share a strange fate.

200
00:19:57,200 --> 00:20:00,030
Stop! You'd kill 
your own friend?!

201
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:03,490
The lord orders it! 
As did our leader!

202
00:20:04,990 --> 00:20:06,540
It's a trick!

203
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:09,080
Now that we know the 
traitors' secret they want

204
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:11,540
to get rid of us by making 
us kill each other.

205
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:15,840
This is a trap for all of us. 
Shinkuro, believe me!

206
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,550
Jubei... Forgive me.

207
00:20:18,930 --> 00:20:20,130
Shinkuro!

208
00:20:21,090 --> 00:20:22,430
His word...

209
00:20:22,850 --> 00:20:23,850
...is law!

210
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:08,140
I avenged Shinkuro and the others myself. 
Genma can't be alive.

211
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:13,730
We're getting close. This place 
is thick with ghosts and blood.

212
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:16,360
Beyond lies Hell itself.

213
00:21:20,610 --> 00:21:24,620
Heaven must have sent 
this mist to help us.

214
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,010
Hey!

215
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:51,020
Double damned mist!

216
00:22:14,870 --> 00:22:18,380
How could he have 
dodged Shijima's claw?

217
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:47,870
Who are you?

218
00:22:47,870 --> 00:22:51,290
I heard a voice 
chanting the sutra.

219
00:22:51,620 --> 00:22:54,830
I was praying for 
the dead villagers.

220
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:59,590
Don't you know an epidemic 
plagues this village?

221
00:23:01,130 --> 00:23:05,930
Poor soul! You'll never 
leave this village alive.

222
00:23:06,220 --> 00:23:09,760
Here now, let us go to the 
land of Buddha together.

223
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:19,400
Have you seen a 
traveling monk here?

224
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:25,530
He'll meet Buddha soon enough. 
I'll send him there.

225
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:27,990
Such a benevolent nun...

226
00:23:36,460 --> 00:23:38,290
Shit! Another cast-off skin!

227
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:52,810
Gone... He uses a 
strange technique...

228
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:05,730
As do you. Very strange indeed !

229
00:24:14,950 --> 00:24:21,750
Answer me. Are there any others 
with you besides the monk?

230
00:24:22,630 --> 00:24:26,130
Of course. And not 
just ten or twenty.

231
00:24:26,130 --> 00:24:28,510
You can send a snake for 
each and it won't be enough.

232
00:24:30,970 --> 00:24:32,220
Liar!

233
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:35,600
All right! I'll 
tell you the truth.

234
00:24:36,680 --> 00:24:40,390
There's two. One's the traveling monk. 
The other...

235
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:41,850
...is right behind you.

236
00:24:44,320 --> 00:24:47,150
Lose the snakes. Down 
to the last one!

237
00:24:53,370 --> 00:24:54,620
You'll be dead soon.

238
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,160
Get rid of them!

239
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:20,980
Now it's your turn to answer.

240
00:25:20,980 --> 00:25:23,810
What are you doing in this village? 
Talk!

241
00:25:42,370 --> 00:25:45,380
Twice failed. Unforgivable.

242
00:25:45,380 --> 00:25:49,380
I cast another line onto your 
neck, but you didn't notice.

243
00:25:49,380 --> 00:25:52,130
In the end, just a 
foolish amateur.

244
00:26:10,860 --> 00:26:12,820
Idiot! There's still time 
to suck the poison out!

245
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:17,240
Poison doesn't work on me. 
My body's immune to it.

246
00:26:19,990 --> 00:26:22,500
I think I've cleared 
my debt to you.

247
00:26:22,500 --> 00:26:25,210
Yes. You saved me.

248
00:26:25,460 --> 00:26:29,710
Your name's Kagero, right? 
What are you going to do now?

249
00:26:29,710 --> 00:26:32,090
That's none of your concern.

250
00:26:33,010 --> 00:26:35,180
If it isn't, then what the 
hell am I doing here?!

251
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:38,850
I have to discover their plan.

252
00:26:39,810 --> 00:26:42,020
By yourself? Impossible!

253
00:26:42,020 --> 00:26:44,180
They're too strong. 
Think this over.

254
00:26:44,690 --> 00:26:46,400
Stay out of my way.

255
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:49,570
I've no reason to 
take orders from you.

256
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,650
Hold a moment, Kunoichi of Koga.

257
00:26:55,650 --> 00:27:00,580
My name is Dakuan. Why 
don't you join me?

258
00:27:00,580 --> 00:27:04,370
This man is my 
trustworthy assistant.

259
00:27:04,870 --> 00:27:07,370
I wasn't planning on 
helping a government spy.

260
00:27:07,370 --> 00:27:09,540
Oh, quit complaining !

261
00:27:09,670 --> 00:27:10,920
What do you say, woman?

262
00:27:11,130 --> 00:27:15,590
Our aims may differ, but we 
three share a common enemy.

263
00:27:15,590 --> 00:27:18,550
And three is mightier than one.

264
00:27:18,550 --> 00:27:21,970
And I happen to have some 
information you don't know.

265
00:27:21,970 --> 00:27:25,020
Such as who is giving 
them their orders.

266
00:27:25,020 --> 00:27:27,100
I'll tell you on the way.

267
00:27:31,110 --> 00:27:32,230
I need no friends.

268
00:27:32,860 --> 00:27:36,740
But I may need your information.

269
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:38,280
Very well.

270
00:27:44,450 --> 00:27:49,120
My, she's a lovely, sexy 
little thing, isn't she!

271
00:27:49,580 --> 00:27:52,420
What's running through that 
twisted skull of yours?

272
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:56,630
Well now, that Kunoichi 
could prove very useful.

273
00:27:56,630 --> 00:28:00,430
She has a technique to poison 
the man she sleeps with.

274
00:28:00,970 --> 00:28:05,680
The big guy you killed had 
been poisoned by her.

275
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:05,770
The big guy you killed had 
been poisoned by her.

276
00:28:53,690 --> 00:28:56,400
Your skill is as 
marvelous as ever.

277
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:59,820
No... He was able to kill a 
mighty ninja like Tessai.

278
00:28:59,820 --> 00:29:03,870
Don't be off guard. It's 
possible he got away.

279
00:29:04,450 --> 00:29:06,700
The four of you 
will check it out.

280
00:29:06,700 --> 00:29:08,870
You're a cautious one, Yurimaru.

281
00:29:09,040 --> 00:29:14,130
We have an important mission. 
We take every precaution.

282
00:29:14,250 --> 00:29:16,090
I know, I know. Don't worry.

283
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:25,800
Only things he killed 
were the fish.

284
00:29:25,800 --> 00:29:28,350
Good. Otherwise we 
wouldn't get our chance.

285
00:29:28,350 --> 00:29:30,600
It's getting quite 
interesting, isn't it?

286
00:29:45,410 --> 00:29:48,580
How is it? Just as we thought?

287
00:29:49,540 --> 00:29:52,460
They poisoned the wells 
and killed the villagers.

288
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:54,540
And then blamed it on plague.

289
00:29:55,210 --> 00:29:58,460
A trick to keep the 
villagers away.

290
00:29:59,340 --> 00:30:04,130
They're planning something... 
quite extraordinary.

291
00:30:14,980 --> 00:30:17,520
I'd like to know what it is.

292
00:30:18,020 --> 00:30:21,070
That's fine, just don't get 
yourself involved too deeply.

293
00:30:21,070 --> 00:30:22,780
It could prove fatal.

294
00:30:44,420 --> 00:30:46,470
I see. Guide the others.

295
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,610
Run for it!

296
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,680
We can't outrun them.

297
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:32,720
Kagero...

298
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:53,740
So, the pollen is mixed 
with a sleeping potion.

299
00:31:53,740 --> 00:31:55,660
But how long will 
it hold them back?

300
00:31:56,750 --> 00:31:58,120
Why, you!

301
00:31:58,920 --> 00:31:59,920
Girl!

302
00:32:00,130 --> 00:32:02,460
You have to hold them off 
till Jubei kills him!

303
00:32:02,460 --> 00:32:04,420
Do whatever it takes!

304
00:32:18,690 --> 00:32:20,440
Call off your bees!

305
00:32:21,560 --> 00:32:24,150
I'm afraid you must 
beat me first.

306
00:32:26,150 --> 00:32:28,280
You don't know anything, do you?

307
00:32:28,280 --> 00:32:31,200
Do you think I ran in 
here to escape you?

308
00:32:31,780 --> 00:32:32,780
No, I don't.

309
00:32:32,780 --> 00:32:35,490
I have lots of questions for 
you, but no time to ask them.

310
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:39,540
No, just one thing. Tell 
me, is Himuro Genma alive?

311
00:32:39,710 --> 00:32:41,420
So what if he is?

312
00:32:41,420 --> 00:32:44,090
I ask because I sent 
him to Hell before.

313
00:32:44,210 --> 00:32:46,880
Is that so? Then I'll 
have to be careful.

314
00:32:47,010 --> 00:32:51,470
Unlike Genma, I don't have the 
technique to reincarnate myself.

315
00:32:51,800 --> 00:32:53,100
Reincarnation?

316
00:33:01,850 --> 00:33:04,190
Fool! You've damaged the hive!

317
00:33:21,040 --> 00:33:23,790
The second you come up for 
air is the second you die!

318
00:33:26,670 --> 00:33:29,920
He's mine! Keep 
your hands off him!

319
00:33:30,220 --> 00:33:31,970
What about the 
Kunoichi and the monk?

320
00:33:31,970 --> 00:33:35,760
My bees should finish 
them off soon.

321
00:33:45,270 --> 00:33:48,980
How far is he trying to run? 
What a poor loser!

322
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:06,630
Do you think he's fallen 
victim to the throat needle?

323
00:34:17,300 --> 00:34:21,930
No... The bees in the hive are 
trying to escape the water.

324
00:34:21,930 --> 00:34:26,270
Desperately stinging his body as 
they do so... Mushizo's lost.

325
00:34:37,950 --> 00:34:40,490
Took his time about it, but 
he finally killed him.

326
00:34:54,930 --> 00:35:00,510
Reincarnation? Did he mean Himuro 
Genma's come back to life?

327
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:03,350
Impossible!

328
00:35:16,240 --> 00:35:20,160
Reincarnation? I've heard 
about the technique.

329
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:26,540
You must control your flesh and 
blood down to the tiniest bones.

330
00:35:26,670 --> 00:35:32,460
If your limbs or even your head were 
cut off, you'd be able to rejoin them.

331
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:36,170
Reincarnation... That's a 
technique of immortality.

332
00:35:36,170 --> 00:35:38,300
It can never be achieved 
by a human being.

333
00:35:38,720 --> 00:35:41,430
Well, well... That's 
a hell of a trick!

334
00:35:41,430 --> 00:35:45,890
Anyway, the Kimon monsters 
are now all after you.

335
00:35:45,890 --> 00:35:48,190
That means I can move easily.

336
00:35:51,150 --> 00:35:53,570
If you're lucky, 
we'll meet again.

337
00:35:56,440 --> 00:35:58,780
Why did you join him?

338
00:35:59,410 --> 00:36:02,580
He hired me... For 100 ryo.

339
00:36:02,780 --> 00:36:05,660
You're a mercenary ninja? One 
who'd do anything for money?

340
00:36:06,540 --> 00:36:08,420
You could say that.

341
00:36:08,420 --> 00:36:12,460
But he suckered me into it. 
Trapped me.

342
00:36:13,090 --> 00:36:15,920
I'll die of his 
poison in half a day.

343
00:36:17,220 --> 00:36:21,050
He promised me an antidote 
along with the gold.

344
00:36:21,050 --> 00:36:25,180
That's why I work for him. 
I can't back out now.

345
00:36:25,520 --> 00:36:28,600
You'd better run for it while 
I divert their attention.

346
00:36:29,270 --> 00:36:32,440
I can't do that. I'd 
owe you another debt.

347
00:36:32,900 --> 00:36:34,400
Forget about any debts.

348
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:37,780
And I told you I don't have 
to take orders from you.

349
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:40,320
Besides, I'm ready 
to die any moment.

350
00:36:40,410 --> 00:36:42,370
Relax. Stop pretending 
you're so tough.

351
00:36:42,370 --> 00:36:43,620
What?!

352
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:47,410
It's this humid weather!

353
00:36:47,410 --> 00:36:51,880
I wish a storm would come and 
cool off that hot head of yours.

354
00:36:56,050 --> 00:36:58,090
You're in no position 
to worry about me.

355
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:05,890
Storm...

356
00:37:07,930 --> 00:37:12,150
They came on the night 
of that big storm...

357
00:37:16,730 --> 00:37:19,610
Hey, where can I get a 
good look at this area?

358
00:37:26,200 --> 00:37:27,580
How about there?

359
00:37:27,580 --> 00:37:28,830
Nothing.

360
00:37:28,830 --> 00:37:30,500
Keep looking !

361
00:37:43,470 --> 00:37:44,470
Hanza...

362
00:37:44,470 --> 00:37:45,180
Wait!

363
00:37:46,260 --> 00:37:46,970
Hanza!

364
00:37:51,940 --> 00:37:54,600
There's a cliff in front of you! 
Stop!

365
00:37:55,560 --> 00:37:56,650
Damn!

366
00:38:10,660 --> 00:38:11,790
Gotcha!

367
00:38:11,790 --> 00:38:12,290
Shit!

368
00:38:20,710 --> 00:38:24,970
Fool! They got you so soon? 
We still had a lot to do.

369
00:38:30,310 --> 00:38:33,310
The scent of blasted flesh, 
grilled to perfection...

370
00:38:33,310 --> 00:38:35,230
Such a lovely smell.

371
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:01,340
Don't... move...

372
00:39:01,630 --> 00:39:03,800
That's enough. Let me go.

373
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,840
It's my fault I fell 
for their trap.

374
00:39:06,220 --> 00:39:07,890
Shut up! Don't talk!

375
00:39:08,890 --> 00:39:11,180
Let go of me! I don't 
want your help.

376
00:39:11,510 --> 00:39:13,140
Shut up!

377
00:39:21,270 --> 00:39:23,990
Go on, grab it!

378
00:39:50,050 --> 00:39:54,930
I am Utsutsu Mujuro. I've been 
longing to challenge you.

379
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:03,860
He's here for me. Stay here.

380
00:40:16,700 --> 00:40:21,040
You lured me here because I'm blind? 
Is that your plan?

381
00:40:35,520 --> 00:40:38,100
If you want to kill me, 
then don't make a sound.

382
00:40:39,270 --> 00:40:43,110
That's impossible. But maybe I can 
turn your skill to my advantage.

383
00:41:18,390 --> 00:41:19,890
I told you to stay back!

384
00:41:26,820 --> 00:41:29,070
Your sight is your weakness.

385
00:41:32,740 --> 00:41:33,490
Outta the way!

386
00:41:46,090 --> 00:41:47,050
Impossible...

387
00:42:32,220 --> 00:42:35,510
The cargo from the ship that ran 
aground in the storm two days ago.

388
00:42:35,510 --> 00:42:37,640
That's what they're after.

389
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:40,970
They butchered the villagers 
like animals for it.

390
00:42:54,650 --> 00:42:56,820
Where does this road lead?

391
00:43:01,100 --> 00:43:03,100
Chamberlain!

392
00:43:04,830 --> 00:43:06,250
Lord Hyobu, is it true?

393
00:43:06,250 --> 00:43:11,800
That the Koga ninja who went to investigate 
Shimoda Village were wiped out?

394
00:43:12,050 --> 00:43:13,380
Exactly.

395
00:43:13,380 --> 00:43:17,220
But how?! This is an emergency.

396
00:43:17,220 --> 00:43:19,510
I'll take my men to the 
village immediately.

397
00:43:19,680 --> 00:43:20,850
No!

398
00:43:20,850 --> 00:43:24,060
If this is serious 
enough to jeopardize the

399
00:43:24,060 --> 00:43:27,600
safety of our clan, we 
must move very carefully.

400
00:43:28,350 --> 00:43:30,770
That's how small clans 
like ours survive.

401
00:43:30,770 --> 00:43:31,820
But...

402
00:43:32,150 --> 00:43:35,610
The Kunoichi who survived is 
continuing the investigation.

403
00:43:35,740 --> 00:43:37,660
Wait for her report.

404
00:44:37,760 --> 00:44:41,550
Those wheel tracks lead 
to Kashima Harbor.

405
00:44:41,550 --> 00:44:44,100
They're probably going to 
transport the cargo out by boat.

406
00:44:44,430 --> 00:44:44,970
If I don't stop them...

407
00:44:44,970 --> 00:44:48,890
those dead villagers and the Koga 
ninja will never rest in peace.

408
00:44:55,440 --> 00:44:59,490
Listen well, you who labor 
for the Shogun of the Dark.

409
00:44:59,490 --> 00:45:03,030
This mission could very 
well decide our fate!

410
00:45:03,320 --> 00:45:06,410
This ship will reach 
Mochizuki in a few hours.

411
00:45:06,410 --> 00:45:09,540
We must retrieve the 
cargo at any cost!

412
00:45:09,830 --> 00:45:12,170
Understood? At any cost!

413
00:45:31,940 --> 00:45:34,520
The towns must have cleared out 
out of fear of the epidemic.

414
00:45:35,360 --> 00:45:38,280
One horse was enough to 
scare them all away.

415
00:45:42,990 --> 00:45:46,200
So, you're still alive. 
I've been worried.

416
00:45:46,990 --> 00:45:49,200
It's nice to see you, too.

417
00:45:49,450 --> 00:45:52,750
They're waiting for a boat 
to transport the cargo.

418
00:45:53,290 --> 00:45:55,250
Did you check what the cargo is?

419
00:45:55,380 --> 00:46:00,130
No, I couldn't reach it. But 
I can guess what it is.

420
00:46:00,130 --> 00:46:02,220
Actually, I guessed before 
I came to Mochizuki.

421
00:46:02,760 --> 00:46:03,760
What?!

422
00:46:03,760 --> 00:46:05,890
You haven't figured it out?

423
00:46:05,090 --> 00:46:08,430
It's something that has 
to do with your past.

424
00:46:09,350 --> 00:46:10,430
It's gold, boy.

425
00:46:10,430 --> 00:46:15,060
Gold produced from that 
secret Yamashiro mine.

426
00:46:16,980 --> 00:46:19,150
The ship ran aground 
during the storm...

427
00:46:19,150 --> 00:46:23,320
Probably on its way to the Shogun 
of the Dark with caskets of gold.

428
00:46:23,490 --> 00:46:27,830
Gold that's probably been 
hidden for the last five years.

429
00:46:28,080 --> 00:46:30,290
If it reaches his hands,

430
00:46:30,290 --> 00:46:32,960
he'll be powerful enough to 
topple the Tokugawa government...

431
00:46:32,960 --> 00:46:35,120
...and plunge the country 
into another civil war.

432
00:46:35,330 --> 00:46:37,380
We have to stop it at any cost!

433
00:46:41,800 --> 00:46:44,430
Dakuan, you've got a tail.

434
00:46:44,430 --> 00:46:45,180
What?!

435
00:46:55,730 --> 00:46:57,610
Kunoichi, what are you doing?!

436
00:46:57,940 --> 00:47:01,360
I'm calling a Koga ninja 
bird that's in this village.

437
00:47:01,980 --> 00:47:03,440
Calling a bird? What for?

438
00:47:03,950 --> 00:47:06,530
It'll carry my message to 
the castle chamberlain.

439
00:47:06,780 --> 00:47:08,780
I've discovered 
what they're after.

440
00:47:08,780 --> 00:47:12,580
Ln two hours, his army 
will surround the town.

441
00:47:12,100 --> 00:47:14,580
It's not as easy as you think.

442
00:47:14,910 --> 00:47:18,040
The Mochizuki clan will probably 
ignore this whole thing.

443
00:47:18,500 --> 00:47:19,040
Why?!

444
00:47:23,800 --> 00:47:25,630
The future of the 
clan is at stake.

445
00:47:25,630 --> 00:47:28,720
This is a power struggle between the 
Tokugawa and the Shogun of the Dark.

446
00:47:28,720 --> 00:47:32,930
If a small clan like the Mochizuki 
got involved, it'd be smashed !

447
00:47:36,060 --> 00:47:39,610
See nothing, hear nothing. That's 
the best course for the clan.

448
00:47:51,330 --> 00:47:53,870
We'll find out soon whether or 
not the Mochizuki will move.

449
00:48:15,560 --> 00:48:16,430
Shit!

450
00:48:17,440 --> 00:48:18,190
Uh-oh!

451
00:48:32,530 --> 00:48:33,740
Kunoichi in Custody

452
00:48:33,740 --> 00:48:38,500
Kunoichi in Custody It must have 
happened when I went off for a moment.

453
00:48:38,500 --> 00:48:39,370
Kunoichi in Custody

454
00:48:39,830 --> 00:48:42,790
She's most likely dead.

455
00:48:43,670 --> 00:48:46,710
Well, we've got work to do.

456
00:48:46,710 --> 00:48:49,180
We'll get no help from 
the Mochizuki clan.

457
00:48:52,760 --> 00:48:55,140
Don't fall for their trap.

458
00:48:55,560 --> 00:48:56,390
Wait!

459
00:48:57,730 --> 00:49:00,310
What if their ship comes 
while you're at it?

460
00:49:00,310 --> 00:49:03,810
Let her alone! A dead Kunoichi 
isn't that important!

461
00:49:04,820 --> 00:49:06,690
Not important compared 
to the great mission?

462
00:49:06,690 --> 00:49:08,690
You're as much of a 
monster as they are!

463
00:49:08,690 --> 00:49:13,320
Fool! When you fight monsters, you 
become one yourself or you can't win!

464
00:49:14,780 --> 00:49:19,330
You damn fool boy! Go ahead ! 
GO TO HELL!

465
00:49:19,330 --> 00:49:22,670
Damn you... !

466
00:50:06,090 --> 00:50:06,880
Are you all right?

467
00:50:09,460 --> 00:50:10,170
Kagero!

468
00:50:29,320 --> 00:50:33,200
You're hard to kill, but... 
Woman, release his pain.

469
00:50:56,220 --> 00:50:58,550
Kibagami Jubei?

470
00:50:58,890 --> 00:51:01,890
Yes. But we've already 
killed them all.

471
00:51:01,890 --> 00:51:04,640
Idiot! They still live.

472
00:51:05,980 --> 00:51:07,400
I'll kill him, for sure!

473
00:51:07,400 --> 00:51:11,860
Stay where you are. Lure 
them there and kill them.

474
00:51:12,150 --> 00:51:13,400
Understand?

475
00:51:13,400 --> 00:51:13,860
Yes.

476
00:51:20,080 --> 00:51:22,540
Never would I have 
imagined to see him here.

477
00:51:22,750 --> 00:51:25,290
I look forward to seeing 
you again, Jubei.

478
00:51:27,040 --> 00:51:28,540
Genma!

479
00:51:33,590 --> 00:51:34,920
I'm sorry.

480
00:51:35,840 --> 00:51:39,890
Forget it. I take it the castle 
retainers haven't taken any action?

481
00:51:41,390 --> 00:51:43,770
It's been two hours.

482
00:51:43,430 --> 00:51:45,770
I see.

483
00:51:49,690 --> 00:51:53,400
Why... You knew it was a trap, 
but you came to help me.

484
00:51:53,400 --> 00:51:56,820
It was stupid. Why 
risk your life for me?

485
00:51:56,820 --> 00:51:58,780
Because I can't just 
toss aside my comrade.

486
00:51:58,910 --> 00:51:59,660
Comrade?

487
00:52:00,370 --> 00:52:04,540
Yes. We've saved each other 
over and over since yesterday.

488
00:52:04,540 --> 00:52:05,910
You're a precious friend to me.

489
00:52:15,170 --> 00:52:15,920
Stay!

490
00:52:16,470 --> 00:52:19,090
The Mochizuki clan is 
staying out of this one.

491
00:52:19,090 --> 00:52:20,930
Your mission is over.

492
00:52:21,300 --> 00:52:24,680
No, it isn't. I'm 
still in debt to you.

493
00:52:26,430 --> 00:52:28,020
You can pay it back later.

494
00:52:28,890 --> 00:52:31,110
Not if you're dead !

495
00:52:31,230 --> 00:52:33,020
I'll repay it here!

496
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:44,790
What are you doing?

497
00:52:50,960 --> 00:52:54,420
The old man told me how 
to counteract the poison.

498
00:52:55,710 --> 00:52:57,510
"Kill poison with poison."

499
00:52:57,880 --> 00:53:02,180
He said if you make love to a 
poison-taster like me, you'll be cured.

500
00:53:04,850 --> 00:53:06,390
Take me...

501
00:54:02,660 --> 00:54:05,780
We've been waiting ! Load 
the ship immediately!

502
00:54:32,310 --> 00:54:35,600
You! Well, I warned 
you, didn't I?

503
00:54:35,600 --> 00:54:38,860
We've lost. We'll never 
beat that many men.

504
00:54:39,360 --> 00:54:43,450
I don't intend to let them go. 
We'll make our stand soon.

505
00:54:44,320 --> 00:54:45,570
What are you planning?

506
00:54:44,820 --> 00:54:48,580
When they finish 
loading the gold...

507
00:54:48,580 --> 00:54:50,490
...go to the tower 
and ring the bell.

508
00:54:50,790 --> 00:54:53,100
While they're distracted, 
I'll sneak onboard the ship.

509
00:54:54,250 --> 00:54:57,130
When we're out at sea, 
we won't need any storm.

510
00:54:57,130 --> 00:54:58,880
I'll sink it myself.

511
00:54:59,000 --> 00:54:59,880
Very well.

512
00:55:00,750 --> 00:55:04,470
By the way, did you make 
love to that Kunoichi?

513
00:55:06,010 --> 00:55:09,930
None of your damn business! 
Now get going !

514
00:55:32,160 --> 00:55:34,870
Genma... Where are you?

515
00:55:34,100 --> 00:55:38,250
When I die, I'll take 
you to hell with me!

516
00:56:10,450 --> 00:56:11,990
The Mochizuki clan?! They're 
moving against them!

517
00:56:18,330 --> 00:56:20,460
Ah, Kunoichi! You've 
done a fine job.

518
00:56:20,830 --> 00:56:22,880
Hurry, before they get away! 
Where are the others?

519
00:56:24,380 --> 00:56:27,220
Don't worry. They've got 
this place surrounded.

520
00:56:27,760 --> 00:56:29,640
Then hurry!

521
00:56:48,030 --> 00:56:49,860
Jubei...

522
00:56:57,870 --> 00:56:59,460
Kagero!

523
00:57:01,000 --> 00:57:02,330
Stop! It's a trap!

524
00:57:03,130 --> 00:57:07,460
Fool! Sakaki Hyobu 
died two days ago.

525
00:57:21,520 --> 00:57:23,360
I killed him personally.

526
00:57:23,860 --> 00:57:26,610
Genma!

527
00:57:50,090 --> 00:57:53,510
Sir, please get aboard 
the ship quickly.

528
00:57:53,510 --> 00:57:57,100
The retainers of the Shogun 
of the Dark are waiting.

529
00:57:57,930 --> 00:58:02,140
Leave Jubei to me. Upon my 
honor, I will not fail.

530
00:58:03,100 --> 00:58:06,440
Please grant me this one wish.

531
00:58:10,740 --> 00:58:12,530
Very well then. Go.

532
00:58:40,520 --> 00:58:44,480
Stay out of this. Don't shame me 
any more than you already have.

533
00:58:46,980 --> 00:58:48,610
So, you are Genma?

534
00:58:49,150 --> 00:58:52,650
The Mochizuki clan 
suspects nothing, correct?

535
00:58:52,650 --> 00:58:54,660
Yes. All is well.

536
00:58:54,660 --> 00:58:59,080
You've done a splendid job. I 
admire you Devils of Kimon.

537
00:58:59,160 --> 00:59:02,200
The Shogun of the 
Dark will be pleased.

538
00:59:35,360 --> 00:59:37,410
Writhe in pain before you die.

539
01:00:13,360 --> 01:00:16,360
Yurimaru seems to have 
suffered some ill fortune!

540
01:00:16,360 --> 01:00:18,820
How careless of him to 
have fallen into my trap.

541
01:00:21,200 --> 01:00:23,660
It was your own fault, Yurimaru.

542
01:00:27,410 --> 01:00:28,460
Let's go.

543
01:00:31,540 --> 01:00:32,540
Kagero!

544
01:00:42,390 --> 01:00:44,560
Hang on! Kagero!

545
01:00:48,440 --> 01:00:49,730
Jubei...

546
01:00:50,230 --> 01:00:51,560
I told you not to come.

547
01:00:53,020 --> 01:00:56,740
I wanted... to apologize...

548
01:01:00,240 --> 01:01:02,660
It was the first time...

549
01:01:02,660 --> 01:01:06,410
You didn't treat me like 
some poison-taster...

550
01:01:06,410 --> 01:01:09,580
...but like a normal woman.

551
01:02:01,800 --> 01:02:07,470
Jubei... I'm glad... 
I met you...

552
01:03:41,860 --> 01:03:47,490
Genma, with the gold's help our 
dream will soon be reality.

553
01:03:47,490 --> 01:03:48,530
"Our" dream?

554
01:03:48,530 --> 01:03:54,450
Our great dream to topple the Shogunate 
and restore the reign of the Toyotomi.

555
01:03:54,660 --> 01:03:56,580
You don't understand...

556
01:03:56,580 --> 01:04:00,170
How we, the former retainers 
of Toyotomi, have suffered.

557
01:04:00,500 --> 01:04:04,090
Now it'll be the Tokugawa who 
suffer the agony and torment.

558
01:04:04,090 --> 01:04:09,890
We'll use the gold to buy advanced weapons 
from Spain and defeat the Tokugawa.

559
01:04:09,890 --> 01:04:14,390
That is the dream of all of us who 
work for the Shogun of the Dark.

560
01:04:15,230 --> 01:04:16,390
Nonsense.

561
01:04:18,100 --> 01:04:19,350
What did you say?!

562
01:04:19,560 --> 01:04:21,310
I said nonsense.

563
01:04:21,310 --> 01:04:24,400
Hold your tongue! 
You're a mere ninja!

564
01:04:24,400 --> 01:04:26,360
My dream is different.

565
01:04:26,360 --> 01:04:29,320
The gold isn't going to 
the Shogun of the Dark.

566
01:04:29,320 --> 01:04:30,070
What?!

567
01:04:30,070 --> 01:04:32,280
We, the Devils of Kimon, 
will take the gold.

568
01:04:32,410 --> 01:04:33,950
You impudent... !

569
01:04:35,950 --> 01:04:40,290
I'll use it to organize the most 
powerful army of ninja ever.

570
01:04:40,290 --> 01:04:44,920
And we'll rule the country with 
terror and power from the shadows.

571
01:04:45,210 --> 01:04:48,170
Anyone who opposes me, 
Tokugawa or Toyotomi...

572
01:04:48,170 --> 01:04:51,220
...even the Shogun of the 
Dark himself, shall die.

573
01:04:52,640 --> 01:04:56,810
Meaning the true Shogun of the Dark... 
will be me.

574
01:05:14,280 --> 01:05:20,120
Well now, you're here! I was 
just wishing you'd come.

575
01:05:20,120 --> 01:05:21,210
I'm glad to hear that.

576
01:05:21,710 --> 01:05:23,380
Of course.

577
01:05:23,380 --> 01:05:28,880
Without your help, sinking a big 
ship like this would be impossible!

578
01:05:35,260 --> 01:05:36,350
Pathetic old fool!

579
01:05:37,970 --> 01:05:38,850
Over here.

580
01:05:49,530 --> 01:05:50,490
What's wrong?

581
01:05:51,320 --> 01:05:54,370
Fire in the hold ! 
We're gonna sink!

582
01:05:54,490 --> 01:05:56,200
Idiot! Put out the fire!

583
01:05:56,330 --> 01:05:58,410
Impossible! It's a sea of flame!

584
01:05:58,540 --> 01:06:01,160
Put it out! Fight it!

585
01:06:01,290 --> 01:06:03,290
Move it! Move it!

586
01:06:03,670 --> 01:06:05,130
Forget it! Run!

587
01:06:14,050 --> 01:06:14,800
Master Genma!

588
01:06:15,970 --> 01:06:17,430
Pass this message to everyone:

589
01:06:17,560 --> 01:06:22,730
"Abandon ship and hide yourselves. 
I'll call for you someday."

590
01:06:22,730 --> 01:06:23,730
Go.

591
01:07:02,430 --> 01:07:03,440
Genma!

592
01:07:06,600 --> 01:07:09,690
I see you brought back some 
devils from your trip to Hell.

593
01:07:18,700 --> 01:07:20,540
Kibagami Jubei...

594
01:07:20,660 --> 01:07:23,100
I should've finished 
you with my own hands.

595
01:07:24,290 --> 01:07:26,960
Stop your whining. 
It's too late.

596
01:07:28,840 --> 01:07:32,340
You want to avenge 
the Kunoichi Kagero?

597
01:07:32,550 --> 01:07:35,760
She was trash in comparison 
to what I've lost.

598
01:07:39,800 --> 01:07:41,560
You alone I can't forgive!

599
01:08:32,230 --> 01:08:35,570
I won't kill you yet. Not 
before I make you suffer.

600
01:08:35,900 --> 01:08:38,150
I'll make you pay for 
smashing my dream.

601
01:08:38,360 --> 01:08:43,160
Your dream? That you were going to 
be the true Shogun of the Dark?

602
01:08:44,120 --> 01:08:45,580
Don't make me laugh.

603
01:08:46,080 --> 01:08:51,130
If you became shogun, you'd 
make this a world of devils.

604
01:08:51,790 --> 01:08:56,550
If you enjoy their company so much... 
then go back to hell!

605
01:09:13,770 --> 01:09:15,360
I'll kill you!

606
01:09:18,700 --> 01:09:20,780
No one can kill me.

607
01:09:25,200 --> 01:09:28,080
You of all people 
should know by now...

608
01:09:31,000 --> 01:09:33,840
I am immortal.

609
01:09:37,010 --> 01:09:38,380
Is that so?

610
01:09:49,680 --> 01:09:53,190
If you keep coming 
back to life...

611
01:09:53,730 --> 01:09:57,480
...then I'll kill you as 
many times as it takes!

612
01:11:09,350 --> 01:11:10,890
You fool!

613
01:11:56,270 --> 01:11:59,360
Genma! HERE YOU DIE!

614
01:12:57,790 --> 01:12:59,170
Jubei!

615
01:12:59,170 --> 01:13:03,540
You seem to be rid of the 
poison, thanks to Kagero.

616
01:13:03,710 --> 01:13:08,130
The combination of a poison-tasting 
Kunoichi and a talented lone wolf

617
01:13:08,130 --> 01:13:10,470
worked out even better 
than I had planned.

618
01:13:10,680 --> 01:13:12,050
Go away.

619
01:13:16,640 --> 01:13:21,350
By the way, I'm sorry about losing Kagero. 
A real pity, that!

620
01:13:21,440 --> 01:13:24,690
But for a scant few 
moments, she was able to

621
01:13:24,690 --> 01:13:27,860
be an ordinary girl and 
make love with you.

622
01:13:28,690 --> 01:13:30,700
Was that part of your plan, too?

623
01:13:30,700 --> 01:13:35,870
Exactly. To read and control peoples' 
hearts is the true secret of the ninja.

624
01:13:37,540 --> 01:13:42,170
Still, only true sincerity 
can move the human heart.

625
01:13:42,170 --> 01:13:45,040
A twisted old bastard 
like me couldn't do it.

626
01:13:45,170 --> 01:13:48,920
You're a hell of a guy. 
I really admire you.

627
01:13:48,920 --> 01:13:51,930
As promised, I'll be waiting 
in Edo with your 100 ryo.

628
01:13:51,930 --> 01:13:53,850
Come and get it, if 
you're still alive.

629
01:14:00,690 --> 01:14:04,190
That makes us even. Now 
never cross my path again.

630
01:14:05,190 --> 01:14:08,900
You've beaten me. I thought I'd 
shut your mouth in Edo, but...

631
01:14:08,900 --> 01:14:12,950
Still, in your condition you likely 
won't even make it to the shore.

632
01:14:12,950 --> 01:14:15,660
Everything will end 
just as I planned.
